  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></math>.</p><p>So</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Note <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is continuous&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and differentiable except at integer.&#39;</p>",
